※ pl4g-test: compile=fail
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4422 LANG_MATCH_WILDCARD_TAKES_NO_NAME

※ A pattern that names one alternative binds what that alternative carries.
※ `_` names every alternative left, and those may carry different things or
※ nothing at all, so there is no one value a name after it could stand for.

let hundred: mut u8 = 100u8
let seven: mut u8 = 7u8

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    match hundred ÷ seven:
        u8(q):
            return q
        _(rest):
            return 1u6
